# Brand source masters — large binaries kept out of git deliberately.
# GitHub warns above 50MB per file and these total ~212MB, which would bloat
# every clone forever. The scripts that consume them are tracked; the masters
# themselves live outside the repo. See brand/README.md.
brand/*.blend
brand/*.blend[0-9]*
brand/NEX VIDEO REBRAND.mp4
